@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api
@patientToken = {{loginPatient.response.body.token}}
@pharmacyToken = {{loginPharmacy.response.body.token}}

### 1. Obtener Branding público de Farmacia Dalton (esperado: 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pharmacies/farmacia-dalton/branding
Accept: application/json

### 2. Login como Paciente — Camila (esperado: 200 OK)
# @name loginPatient
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "email": "paciente@dalton.com.ar",
    "password": "paciente123"
}

### 3. Ver perfil autenticado de Camila (esperado: 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

### 4. Acceso a zona Paciente con token de Paciente (esperado: 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/patient/ping
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

### 5. Acceso a zona Farmacia con token de Paciente (esperado: 403 Forbidden)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pharmacy/ping
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

### 6. Login como Farmacia Dalton — B2B (esperado: 200 OK)
# @name loginPharmacy
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "email": "farmacia@dalton.com.ar",
    "password": "dalton123"
}

### 7. Acceso a zona Farmacia con token de Farmacia (esperado: 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pharmacy/ping
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmacyToken}}